<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
            <% /* Template compartilhado Reset Password Success.
                Parâmetros: moduleLabel, basePath */ %>
            <% const _moduleLabel = typeof moduleLabel !== 'undefined' ? moduleLabel : 'WDGestor'; %>
            <% const _basePath = (typeof basePath === 'string' && basePath && basePath !== '/') ? basePath : '/gestor'; %>
            <%- include('partials/basepath-var') %>
        <title>Senha redefinida - <%= _moduleLabel %></title>
    <%- include('partials/favicon') %>

    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Bootstrap Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= _basePath %>/css/login.css?v=<%= Date.now() %>">
</head>
<body class="login-bg">
    <main class="min-vh-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center px-3 py-4">
    <div class="login-card auth-card-shell card shadow-lg border-0">
      <div class="card-body p-4 p-sm-5 text-center">
        <div class="mb-4">
               <img src="<%= _basePath %>/images/logoWDGestor.png" alt="<%= _moduleLabel %>" class="brand-logo mb-2" />
               <span class="auth-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i>Módulo Gestor</span>
               <h1 class="auth-card-title">Nova senha salva</h1>
               <p class="auth-subtitle mb-0">Sua senha foi atualizada e seu acesso já pode ser retomado pelo login.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-3">
            <span class="auth-status-icon is-success">
            <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="message auth-subtitle fs-6 mb-4">
            <%= message %>
        </div>

        <div class="auth-info-box text-start">
            <h6><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-2"></i>Próximos passos:</h6>
            <p>Você já pode fazer login com sua nova senha. Mantenha-a em local seguro e não a compartilhe com ninguém.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4">
               <a href="<%= _basePath %>/login" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right me-2"></i>Fazer Login
            </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Bootstrap JS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>